00:06:59.897 --> 00:07:02.300
- You look back and you see
old Ariana to new Ariana

00:07:02.300 --> 00:07:04.236
and you think about
how much you've learned

00:07:04.236 --> 00:07:05.306
and how much you've grown.

00:07:05.306 --> 00:07:06.557
It's insane.

00:07:06.557 --> 00:07:07.390
- [Ariana] Yeah.

00:07:07.390 --> 00:07:08.457
- Can you pinpoint one or two things

00:07:08.457 --> 00:07:09.897
like the biggest thing you've learned

00:07:09.897 --> 00:07:11.258
over the last maybe four years.

00:07:11.258 --> 00:07:14.258
- When I guess when you just like...

00:07:17.180 --> 00:07:19.013
be yourself, you know.

00:07:19.967 --> 00:07:23.050
And in your most genuine possible way

00:07:24.254 --> 00:07:26.930
and are completely unafraid.

00:07:26.930 --> 00:07:29.033
That's when everything
starts to fall into place.

00:07:29.033 --> 00:07:30.186
And that takes a while,

00:07:30.186 --> 00:07:34.737
especially with so much
public, like you know,

00:07:34.737 --> 00:07:36.122
rumors and opinions.
- Of course.

00:07:36.122 --> 00:07:37.275
- You know what I mean?
- Yeah.

00:07:37.275 --> 00:07:39.005
- You get scared and you
want to hold back a little.

00:07:39.005 --> 00:07:40.656
But then I was like, you know what,

00:07:40.656 --> 00:07:43.879
none of this would be
happening if I would just show,

00:07:43.879 --> 00:07:46.270
I was myself, and I went
out, and I was my silly self

00:07:46.270 --> 00:07:48.119
and there you go and it all goes away.

00:07:48.119 --> 00:07:49.478
And you're like, "that's me."

00:07:49.478 --> 00:07:50.868
- It's a life changer.
- There you go.

00:07:50.868 --> 00:07:53.532
Yeah, when you let go and
you're like here you go.

00:07:53.532 --> 00:07:54.682
Take it or leave it.

00:07:54.682 --> 00:07:56.072
That's as simple as it can be.

00:07:56.072 --> 00:07:59.306
It's like why hold back, you want life.

00:07:59.306 --> 00:08:00.331
Just have fun and be yourself

00:08:00.331 --> 00:08:01.609
and don't worry about the rest.

00:08:01.609 --> 00:08:02.965
It all falls into place.

00:08:02.965 --> 00:08:04.577
- Honestly, I think everyone is

00:08:04.577 --> 00:08:07.247
different and unique
and that's a good thing.

00:08:07.247 --> 00:08:09.631
It's not bad, it's kind of
the best thing in the world.

00:08:09.631 --> 00:08:11.832
You don't want to be like everyone else.

00:08:11.832 --> 00:08:15.561
Growing up in high school,
and just junior high,

00:08:15.561 --> 00:08:20.113
your whole life really, you
have been taught to feel like

00:08:20.113 --> 00:08:22.724
or you want to be like everyone else

00:08:22.724 --> 00:08:26.036
because conceptually you'll be included

00:08:26.036 --> 00:08:29.755
and you'll be like the crowd
but when you think about it,

00:08:29.755 --> 00:08:32.806
when you look at people like Lady Gaga,

00:08:32.806 --> 00:08:35.823
who is so crazy and so
different, so unique.

00:08:35.823 --> 00:08:38.881
And her whole message
is about being yourself

00:08:38.881 --> 00:08:40.079
and being okay with it.

00:08:40.079 --> 00:08:43.797
And she, the reason she
is so successful and so,

00:08:43.797 --> 00:08:45.822
is because she's talented,
because she's different.

00:08:45.822 --> 00:08:47.514
If she was just like Brittany Spears

00:08:47.514 --> 00:08:50.847
or if she was just like me, Nina Dobrev,

00:08:51.998 --> 00:08:53.090
then there would be two of us

00:08:53.090 --> 00:08:54.669
so there'd be nothing special about that.

00:08:54.669 --> 00:08:57.893
So I think what's special is
the fact that you're different

00:08:57.893 --> 00:08:59.621
and is the fact that you're unique.

00:08:59.621 --> 00:09:01.973
And that you can bring
something to the table,

00:09:01.973 --> 00:09:05.223
so if anything, embrace that uniqueness

00:09:06.298 --> 00:09:07.215
and that...

00:09:09.487 --> 00:09:11.806
that thing that you have
that no one else does.

00:09:11.806 --> 00:09:13.665
And expand upon it and make it better.

00:09:13.665 --> 00:09:16.465
And tell everyone about it
and be confident about it,

00:09:16.465 --> 00:09:19.216
because if you're confident
and happy and smiling,

00:09:19.216 --> 00:09:22.564
you will attract confidence,
happiness, and laughter.

00:09:22.564 --> 00:09:25.081
- I'm desperate for
people to start defining

00:09:25.081 --> 00:09:28.217
their hopes and dreams and
wants and needs on their terms.

00:09:28.217 --> 00:09:30.078
Not on what I say.

00:09:30.078 --> 00:09:32.849
I don't care if you want
to hustle 18 hours a day.

00:09:32.849 --> 00:09:35.137
I really don't, I really, really don't.

00:09:35.137 --> 00:09:37.988
I don't care if you want
to buy the New York Jets.

00:09:37.988 --> 00:09:41.003
I don't care what you want or need.

00:09:41.003 --> 00:09:43.813
You need to care about
what you want and need.

00:09:43.813 --> 00:09:45.880
You can't worry about what I'm saying.

00:09:45.880 --> 00:09:48.648
You can't worry about whoever
your flavor of the month is.

00:09:48.648 --> 00:09:50.465
Right, maybe I'm your flavor
of the month right now.

00:09:50.465 --> 00:09:53.848
Maybe your consistent flavor of the life,

00:09:53.848 --> 00:09:55.587
is your mom's point of view,

00:09:55.587 --> 00:09:58.545
is your older brother, who's
guided you with good wisdom

00:09:58.545 --> 00:10:00.282
but wants you to be a lawyer,

00:10:00.282 --> 00:10:01.392
but you don't want to be a lawyer.

00:10:01.392 --> 00:10:02.674
You want to be a street artist,

00:10:02.674 --> 00:10:04.892
you want to take the chance
of being an entrepreneur

00:10:04.892 --> 00:10:06.008
or the reverse.

00:10:06.008 --> 00:10:09.891
Nobody preaches and loves
entrepreneurship more than me

00:10:09.891 --> 00:10:11.269
but I think you see me all the time

00:10:11.269 --> 00:10:13.759
talking about self awareness, are you one.

00:10:13.759 --> 00:10:16.336
This is the golden era
for entrepreneurship.

00:10:16.336 --> 00:10:17.839
People ask me for selfies.

00:10:17.839 --> 00:10:19.132
This will go away.

00:10:19.132 --> 00:10:22.399
It may not go away for me
but it's going to go away.

00:10:22.399 --> 00:10:24.758
You know, entrepreneurship,

00:10:24.758 --> 00:10:27.279
like a rap artist, like a baseball player,

00:10:27.279 --> 00:10:29.513
like the heavy weight, nobody
cares who the heavy weight

00:10:29.513 --> 00:10:31.467
champion of the world is right now.

00:10:31.467 --> 00:10:33.990
Nobody cares who's an active astronaut.

00:10:33.990 --> 00:10:36.838
But they surely did in 1969,

00:10:36.838 --> 00:10:39.552
you know 1954 for the heavy weight champ,

00:10:39.552 --> 00:10:44.535
or they change, they change
and it will always change.

00:10:44.535 --> 00:10:46.288
And it will continuously change

00:10:46.288 --> 00:10:49.718
and right now entrepreneurship
is in this pedestal,

00:10:49.718 --> 00:10:51.459
it's having it's moment.

00:10:51.459 --> 00:10:55.337
And what I'm fearful of, is
that you watch my videos,

00:10:55.337 --> 00:10:57.379
you see my instagram quotes,

00:10:57.379 --> 00:10:58.916
and what I want to
clarify for everybody is

00:10:58.916 --> 00:11:02.857
I hope you understand, I am
not giving advice to everybody.

00:11:02.857 --> 00:11:05.742
The only advice I'd like to
give to everybody is to do you.

00:11:05.742 --> 00:11:07.410
Define what your north star is.

00:11:07.410 --> 00:11:08.922
To understand yourself.

00:11:08.922 --> 00:11:12.574
To understand what your work
life balance ambitions are.

00:11:12.574 --> 00:11:14.433
What your financial ambitions are.

00:11:14.433 --> 00:11:16.596
What your life challenges are.

00:11:16.596 --> 00:11:19.245
The problems that you want
to try to solve and cure.

00:11:19.245 --> 00:11:21.688
As we all do as humans
trying to climb those

00:11:21.688 --> 00:11:23.154
different mountains in our lives.

00:11:23.154 --> 00:11:24.503
What makes you tick?

00:11:24.503 --> 00:11:25.930
That is all that matters.

00:11:25.930 --> 00:11:30.738
I don't do all these daily
videos for you to be like me.

00:11:30.738 --> 00:11:32.611
I don't think anybody should be like me.

00:11:32.611 --> 00:11:34.503
Boy, there are enormous
amounts of pressures

00:11:34.503 --> 00:11:36.619
and sacrifices that I recognize

00:11:36.619 --> 00:11:39.964
that are not just healthy
or valuable to anybody else.

00:11:39.964 --> 00:11:43.067
But its also not healthy or valuable to me

00:11:43.067 --> 00:11:46.214
to do some of the things
that you want me to do.

00:11:46.214 --> 00:11:49.847
Like its not fun for me
to work nine to five.

00:11:49.847 --> 00:11:50.948
I will break.

00:11:50.948 --> 00:11:54.623
I will be as equally
devastated as you would be

00:11:54.623 --> 00:11:56.332
to work 'til midnight every day.

00:11:56.332 --> 00:12:00.366
And so we just need a call
to action for everybody

00:12:00.366 --> 00:12:04.558
to recognize we have to
stop judging everybody else.

00:12:04.558 --> 00:12:05.843
I'm not judging you.

00:12:05.843 --> 00:12:08.451
I'm creating content for
you to use as a barometer

00:12:08.451 --> 00:12:10.777
to try to figure out what you
like and what you don't like

00:12:10.777 --> 00:12:13.547
and I'm trying to provide
value through my words,

00:12:13.547 --> 00:12:15.656
my actions, and my content

00:12:15.656 --> 00:12:18.418
to bring to people to
amplify their worlds.

00:12:18.418 --> 00:12:19.481
And that's really it.

00:12:19.481 --> 00:12:20.787
That's the clarification.

00:12:20.787 --> 00:12:23.799
Like I don't want people to be like me.

00:12:23.799 --> 00:12:25.800
I don't want people to do me.

00:12:25.800 --> 00:12:27.549
I want people to be themselves.

00:12:27.549 --> 00:12:30.321
And they just have to start
with understanding themselves.

00:12:30.321 --> 00:12:32.604
And not trying to be
like me in this moment

00:12:32.604 --> 00:12:34.032
or that person in the next moment,

00:12:34.032 --> 00:12:35.691
that person in the next moment.

00:12:35.691 --> 00:12:37.846
The people that most win
are in tune with themselves

00:12:37.846 --> 00:12:39.869
and figuring themselves out.

